    <p>Ezek megtekintéséhez kattintson <a href="/all-books">ide!</a></p>
        <div style="border:2px solid #a01414;border-radius:4px;padding:28px 36px;margin:20px 0;background:#fdf8f0;text-align:center;font-family:Georgia,serif;">
